        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Loneliness - Reading with Annotations</title>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async\n  src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/mathjax/3.2.2/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\">\n</script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Segoe UI\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    color: #111;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 10px 15px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n  }\n  .page {\n    display: flex;\n    max-width: 1000px;\n  }\n  .left-col {\n    flex: 0 0 68%;\n    padding-right: 15px;\n  }\n  .right-col {\n    flex: 0 0 30%;\n    border-left: 1px solid #ccc;\n    padding-left: 12px;\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n  }\n  p {\n    margin: 2px 0;\n  }\n  .cn {\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n  .underline {\n    text-decoration: underline;\n  }\n  .hl-yellow {\n    background-color: #fff59d;\n  }\n  .hl-green {\n    background-color: #b7e3b0;\n  }\n  .hl-pink {\n    background-color: #f8b7b7;\n  }\n  .bold-header {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin-top: 14px;\n  }\n  .vocab-block {\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 100%;\n  }\n  .red-text {\n    color: #d32f2f;\n  }\n  .green-text {\n    color: #2e7d32;\n  }\n  .bg-yellow {\n    background-color: #fff59d;\n    padding: 2px 3px;\n  }\n  .bg-green {\n    background-color: #b7e3b0;\n    padding: 2px 3px;\n  }\n  .bg-pink {\n    background-color: #f8b7b7;\n    padding: 2px 3px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"left-col\">\n    <p>Ask yourself what&nbsp;<span class=\"underline\">loneliness</span>&nbsp;means to you.</p>\n    <p class=\"cn\">问问自己<span class=\"underline\">孤独</span>对你意味着什么。</p>\n\n    <p>If you're telling yourself that&nbsp;<span class=\"underline\">loneliness</span>&nbsp;is a terrible thing, that</p>\n    <p>it's dangerous to alone, and that you can't fend for yourself in</p>\n    <p>life, you have a problem.</p>\n    <p class=\"cn\">如果你告诉自己孤独是一件可怕的事情，孤独是危险的，你不</p>\n    <p class=\"cn\">能在生活中照顾自己，你就有问题了。</p>\n\n    <p>Therefore, you must change these&nbsp;<span class=\"underline\">irrational</span>&nbsp;ideas for more</p>\n    <p><span class=\"hl-yellow underline\">rational</span> and realistic ones.</p>\n    <p class=\"cn\">所以，你一定要把这些非理性的想法，换成更<span class=\"hl-yellow\">理性</span>、更现实的</p>\n    <p class=\"cn underline\">想法。</p>\n\n    <p class=\"bold-header\">Spend time with you</p>\n    <p style=\"font-weight:bold;\">与你共度时光</p>\n\n    <p>Force yourself to spend time alone.</p>\n    <p class=\"cn underline\">强迫自己花时间独处。</p>\n\n    <p><span class=\"hl-green\">In order to</span> change, you must not only act on a&nbsp;<span class=\"hl-green\">mental</span>&nbsp;or</p>\n    <p>cognitive level, but also on a&nbsp;behavioral&nbsp;level.</p>\n    <p class=\"cn\">为了改变，你不仅要有<span class=\"hl-green\">精神</span>或认知层面上的意识，还要在行为</p>\n    <p class=\"cn\">层面上行动。</p>\n\n    <p><span class=\"hl-yellow\">Program entire</span> weekends alone with your own company.</p>\n    <p class=\"cn\">计划<span class=\"hl-yellow\">整个</span>周末单独由自己陪着自己。</p>\n\n    <p>Enjoy a book or a movie if you want but avoid social media.</p>\n    <p class=\"cn\">如果你愿意，享受一本书或一部电影，但避免社交媒体。</p>\n\n    <p>Go to the movies, to the beach, to the mountains, alone.</p>\n    <p class=\"cn\">去看电影，去海滩，去山上，一个人。</p>\n\n    <p>Take a trip without any company.</p>\n    <p class=\"cn underline\">在没有任何陪伴的情况下进行一次旅行。</p>\n\n    <p>When you do this for long enough, you'll realize that you</p>\n    <p>survived, that your fears weren't real, and that you've met</p>\n    <p>your own true self and now you know yourself better.</p>\n    <p class=\"cn\">当你这样做足够长的时间后，你会意识到你幸存了下来，你的</p>\n    <p class=\"cn\">恐惧不是真的，你已经遇到了真正的自己，现在你更了解自己</p>\n    <p class=\"cn underline\">了。</p>\n\n    <p class=\"bold-header underline\">Connect with others</p>\n    <p style=\"font-weight:bold;\">与他人联系</p>\n\n    <p>Manage your time so you surround yourself with people.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"right-col\">\n    <div class=\"vocab-block bg-yellow\">\n      rational:adj.〔人〕有理性的，理性的;能作出理智决定的，理性的\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"vocab-block bg-green\">\n      mental:adj.精神状态的\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"vocab-block bg-green\">\n      mental illness ;思想的; 精神的; 思考的; 智力的\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"vocab-block bg-yellow\">\n      program：n. 计算机）程序; V.计划；规划；安排\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"vocab-block\">\n      entire:adj. 全部的；整个的\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"vocab-block\">\n      同义词：<span class=\"green-text\">whole</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"vocab-block bg-pink\">\n      为了…（目的）\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"vocab-block bg-pink\">\n      短语：<span class=\"red-text\">in order to</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"vocab-block\">\n      <span class=\"red-text\">so as to</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"vocab-block\">\n      <span class=\"red-text\">so that</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
